Preload the verified speech engine in installed Windows builds.

The restricted utility token cannot probe the engine file under the
per-user application directory. Use the existing pre-lockdown
library preload for the verified engine path, then load the same
path through the ordinary native library loader. Preserve the
sandbox policy and the read-only model-handle transfer.

